    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Pixel Calculator</title>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#1b1b2f;--card:#2a2a45;--accent:#f4c95d;--text:#f5f5f5;--muted:#a0a0c0;--border:#5a5a8a}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace}\nbody{margin:0;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-size:16px;padding:16px}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:4px solid var(--border);box-shadow:8px 8px 0 #000;padding:24px;width:100%;max-width:380px}\nh1{margin:0 0 20px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:2px}\nlabel{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\ninput,select,button{width:100%;padding:12px;font-size:16px;background:#15152a;color:var(--text);border:3px solid var(--border);border-radius:0;margin-bottom:16px}\ninput:focus,select:focus,button:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(244,201,93,.3)}\nbutton{cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:#1b1b2f;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:1px;transition:transform .05s}\nbutton:hover{background:#ffd97a}\nbutton:active{transform:translate(2px,2px);box-shadow:none}\n#result{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:28px;padding:16px;background:#15152a;border:3px solid var(--border);color:var(--accent);word-break:break-all;min-height:60px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"card\">\n<h1>PIXEL CALC</h1>\n<label for=\"left\">Left number</label>\n<input id=\"left\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. -5\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n<label for=\"right\">Right number</label>\n<input id=\"right\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 3\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n<label for=\"operation\">Operation</label>\n<select id=\"operation\">\n<option value=\"add\">Add (+)</option>\n<option value=\"subtract\">Subtract (−)</option>\n<option value=\"multiply\">Multiply (×)</option>\n<option value=\"divide\">Divide (÷)</option>\n</select>\n<button id=\"calculate\" type=\"button\">CALCULATE</button>\n<label for=\"result\">Result</label>\n<output id=\"result\" for=\"left right operation\">0</output>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst left=document.getElementById('left'),right=document.getElementById('right'),op=document.getElementById('operation'),btn=document.getElementById('calculate'),out=document.getElementById('result');\nfunction calc(){\n  const a=left.value.trim(),b=right.value.trim();\n  if(a===''||b===''){out.textContent='Error';return}\n  const x=Number(a),y=Number(b);\n  if(!Number.isFinite(x)||!Number.isFinite(y)){out.textContent='Error';return}\n  let r;\n  switch(op.value){\n    case 'add':r=x+y;break;\n    case 'subtract':r=x-y;break;\n    case 'multiply':r=x*y;break;\n    case 'divide':if(y===0){out.textContent='Error';return}r=x/y;break;\n    default:out.textContent='Error';return;\n  }\n  if(!Number.isFinite(r)){out.textContent='Error';return}\n  out.textContent=String(r);\n}\nbtn.addEventListener('click',calc);\n[left,right,op].forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Enter')calc()}));\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel-Style Two-Number Calculator\n\nAn offline, single-page calculator with a retro pixel aesthetic. Built with plain HTML, CSS and JavaScript — no packages, no network requests, no storage.\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser.\n\n1. Enter a number in **Left number** (negatives supported, e.g. `-5`).\n2. Enter a number in **Right number**.\n3. Choose an **Operation**: Add, Subtract, Multiply, or Divide.\n4. Press **Calculate** (or hit Enter in any field).\n5. The numeric result appears in the output box (no label prefix).\n\nInvalid input (empty fields, non-finite numbers) or division by zero shows exactly `Error`.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup, styles (inline CSS) and calculator logic.\n\n## Keyboard & Accessibility\n\n- All controls are labeled and reachable via keyboard.\n- Visible focus, hover and pressed states.\n- Responsive layout down to 360px wide.\n\n## Constraints\n\n- Offline only; no imports, packages, network, iframes or server code.\n- No `localStorage` or cookies.\n- Uses `addEventListener` (no inline handlers).\n- Total implementation under 200 lines.\n",
      "description": ""
